                    "description": "Step into the vibrant world of David Bowie with this Yoto Card, designed especially for curious kids and families who love music. Filled with some of his biggest hits, it introduces young listeners to the creativity and imagination of one of the most influential artists of all time. Bowie’s songs are full of joyous sounds, unforgettable melodies, and lyrics that spark wonder, making them a natural fit for children who are discovering the joy of music. Each track opens a door to new ideas, from outer space adventures to colorful characters, giving families plenty to enjoy together.",
